import overlays.dl
import document_rendering.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI floating control
    members:
        owner as a pointer to UI floating controls
        key as a string
        node as UI element
        layout as a pointer to UI layout
        visible as a boolean
        anchor as UI point
        clip as UI bounds
        revision as an integer
        available as a floating-point number
        screen width as an integer
        next as a pointer to UI floating control

class:
    patterns:
        UI floating controls
    members:
        view as a pointer to UI view
        overlay as a pointer to UI overlay
        anchor as UI reference
        node as UI element
        layout as UI layout
        first as a pointer to UI floating control
        last as a pointer to UI floating control

to [hide UI floating control] {a pointer to UI floating control:control}:
    if control's visible:
        set control's owner's view's damaged to true
    set control's visible to false
    set control's layout's appearance's hidden to true
    retire UI floating layout (control's layout)

to [place UI floating control] {a pointer to UI floating control:control} [at] {UI point:point} [within] {UI bounds:clip}:
    if (control's visible = false) or (((control's anchor's x != point's x) or (control's anchor's y != point's y)) or (((control's clip's x != clip's x) or (control's clip's y != clip's y)) or ((control's clip's width != clip's width) or (control's clip's height != clip's height)))):
        set control's owner's view's damaged to true
    set control's anchor to point
    set control's clip to clip
    set control's visible to true

to [style UI floating control] {a pointer to UI floating control:control} [using] {UI appearance reference:appearance}:
    if control's node's appearance = appearance:
        return nothing
    set control's node's appearance to appearance
    set control's revision to -1
    set control's owner's view's damaged to true
